 41658                           ;	ZCD Disable bit
 41659                           ;	ZCD = OFF, ZCD module is disabled. ZCD can be enabled by setting the ZCDSEN bit of ZCD
      +                          CON
 41660                           ;	PPSLOCK bit One-Way Set Enable bit
 41661                           ;	PPS1WAY = OFF, PPSLOCKED bit can be set and cleared repeatedly (subject to the unlock 
      +                          sequence)
 41662                           ;	Stack Full/Underflow Reset Enable bit
 41663                           ;	STVREN = ON, Stack full/underflow will cause Reset
 41664                           ;	Low Voltage Programming Enable bit
 41665                           ;	LVP = OFF, HV on MCLR/VPP must be used for programming
 41666                           ;	Extended Instruction Set Enable bit
 41667                           ;	XINST = OFF, Extended Instruction Set and Indexed Addressing Mode disabled
 41668   300003                     	org	3145731
